<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p style="line-height:1.38; background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#292a2e"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Dear {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#292a2e"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">This is {{{Sender.Name}}} with EverQuote! I wanted to reach out to inform you that your account volume and spend have met the requirements of our Core Program for the quarter. Your account will be transitioned out of our standard offering and into our Core Program. As a result, your account will be assigned to me as your dedicated EverQuote Support Representative.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#292a2e"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Let's connect to discuss your agency’s goals and how EverQuote can best support you in achieving them for a successful start to the quarter! You can </span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="{{{Sender.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c}}}"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">book time with me directly here</span></span></span></span></span></a> <span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#292a2e"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">or by replying to this email.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#292a2e"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">For future support for your account you can reach out to me directly or contact Support at 844-707-8800 option 1 or </span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="mailto:support@everquote.com"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">support@everquote.com</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#292a2e"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">. We appreciate your business and look forward to continuing our partnership.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#292a2e"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Sincerely,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#292a2e"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">The EverQuote Customer Success Team</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</body>
</html>